tc10.steps:
1) Go to Network -> Address Objects page, click Add button to add address object;
2) Enter TestVpnHost as the name, choose type as Host, enter 172.16.3.1 as the IP address, select Zone Assignment as VPN;
3) Click OK
4) Go to Network/IPSec VPN/Rules and Settings page, click the Add button. In the pop-up VPN Policy window, select Network tab, in the 'Choose destination network from list' list, select create new address object. Verify that you're able to create a VPN zone AO successfully.

